sequenceDiagram
actor User as "Retailer/Sales/Admin/Operator"
participant UI as "Interface: UI"
participant API as "mainController: Controller"
participant Service as "retailerReceivableService: Service"
participant DB as "PostgreSQL: Database"
User->>UI: Open payment balances
UI->>+API: GET /api/v1/retailer/receivables
API->>+Service: authorizeAndReadScopedBalances(actor)
Service->>+DB: Read canonical ledger, adjustments, disputes and refunds
DB-->>-Service: Scoped balance records
Service-->>-API: Adjusted amount, collected, outstanding, due and refund status
API-->>-UI: Render payment balances

